1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,540
这节课的两个 notebook，都是授课老师跑过的
Two notebooks from this lecture, run by the instructors:

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:06,404
同样的数据 pipeline
the same data pipeline,

3
00:00:06,404 --> 00:00:10,539
同样的 1156 张奶酪照片，同样的五个模型
the same 1,156 cheese photos, the same five models.

4
00:00:10,859 --> 00:00:16,363
Notebook A 选出的冠军是微调过的 MobileNet，准确率 68.97%
Notebook A crowns the fine-tuned MobileNet, at 68.97 percent.

5
00:00:16,683 --> 00:00:22,708
Notebook B 选出的冠军是冻结的 MobileNet，也是 68.97%
Notebook B crowns the frozen MobileNet, also at 68.97 percent,

6
00:00:22,708 --> 00:00:26,304
而微调过的那个只有 62.93
and puts the fine-tuned one at 62.93.

7
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:29,729
那么哪种做法更好，微调还是冻结？
So which recipe is better, fine-tuning or freezing?

8
00:00:30,049 --> 00:00:33,569
而且光看这两张表，你能看出到底哪里不一样吗？
And from these two tables, can you even tell what was different?

9
00:00:33,889 --> 00:00:36,811
有一条线索看得见：看 epochs 这一列
One clue is visible: look at the epochs column.

10
00:00:37,131 --> 00:00:38,681
先记着这个问题
Hold that question.

11
00:00:38,731 --> 00:00:43,809
答案一部分在表里，另一部分在这张表从没写下的东西里
Part of the answer is in the table, and part of it is in what the table never wrote down.

12
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:46,781
然后，微调过的 MobileNet 离开 Colab
Then the fine-tuned MobileNet leaves Colab.

13
00:00:47,101 --> 00:00:49,588
它被打进一个 4 KB 的 tar 包
It gets packed into a 4 kilobyte tarball

14
00:00:49,588 --> 00:00:54,375
在一台只租一个任务那么久的机器上训练，只用一条命令
and trains on a machine you rent for the length of one job, from one command.

15
00:00:54,695 --> 00:00:57,170
这条命令里带着你的 W&B 密钥
That command carries your W&B key.

16
00:00:57,417 --> 00:01:02,185
跟着做，你需要两份带免费 T4 GPU 的 Colab 拷贝
To follow along you need two Colab copies with a free T4 GPU,

17
00:01:02,185 --> 00:01:04,530
一个免费的 W&B 账号、Docker
a free account on W&B, Docker,

18
00:01:04,530 --> 00:01:07,657
以及一个开通了结算的 Google Cloud 项目
and a Google Cloud project with billing.

19
00:01:07,977 --> 00:01:10,913
Vertex AI 任务在运行期间会花钱
Vertex AI jobs cost money while they run;

20
00:01:10,913 --> 00:01:13,993
金色标签标出每一个计费点，不写金额
gold tags mark each point, without amounts.

21
00:01:14,313 --> 00:01:16,524
黄色标签的意思是：暂停一下，自己跑一遍
A yellow tag means pause and run it,

22
00:01:16,524 --> 00:01:18,857
每条命令都在学习指南里
and the study guide has every command.

23
00:01:19,177 --> 00:01:23,678
今天的两个关键词，来自课上：可复现和可追责
Today's two words, from the lecture: reproducibility and accountability.

24
00:01:24,717 --> 00:01:28,452
课上从让深度学习变好的三个杠杆讲起
The lecture starts from three levers for better deep learning:

25
00:01:28,452 --> 00:01:31,224
更多数据、更好的模型、更快的硬件
more data, better models, and faster hardware.

26
00:01:31,544 --> 00:01:34,338
今天拉第三个：你去租硬件
Today we pull the third one: you rent hardware.

27
00:01:34,658 --> 00:01:37,368
再加上能看出它有没有用的记账
And you add the bookkeeping that shows whether it helped.

28
00:01:37,617 --> 00:01:39,252
在 Cheese App 的路线图上
On the Cheese App roadmap,

29
00:01:39,252 --> 00:01:43,718
围住实验追踪和基线模型的那个虚线框，就是今天
the dashed box around experiment tracking and baseline models is today.

30
00:01:44,038 --> 00:01:46,726
你的第三个项目里程碑要的正是这个
Your third milestone asks for exactly this.

31
00:01:46,967 --> 00:01:49,250
一个实验的每一部分该放在哪里？
Where does each piece of an experiment go?

32
00:01:49,570 --> 00:01:54,017
代码放 GitHub，数据放第 11 讲的版本管理
Code to GitHub, data to the versioning from lecture 11,

33
00:01:54,017 --> 00:01:58,060
环境放 pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock
and the environment to pyproject.toml and uv.lock.

34
00:01:58,380 --> 00:02:01,047
权重、指标和日志还没有地方放
Weights, metrics and logs have no home yet.

35
00:02:01,367 --> 00:02:04,138
一个完整的 run 应该存下七样东西
A complete run should keep seven things:

36
00:02:04,138 --> 00:02:08,364
环境、代码、数据、模型、指标、产物和笔记
environment, code, data, model, metrics, artifacts and notes.

37
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:13,976
课程用的是 Weights & Biases，简称 W&B，它帮你托管
The course uses Weights & Biases, W&B for short, which is hosted for you.

38
00:02:14,296 --> 00:02:18,307
MLflow 是常见的选择，用在你必须自己托管的时候
MLflow is the usual choice if you must host it yourself.

39
00:02:18,550 --> 00:02:19,929
这是地图
Here is the map.

40
00:02:19,979 --> 00:02:24,966
上面是 Colab 这条线：notebook A 把文件装进一个目录再上传
On top, the Colab lane: notebook A fills a folder and uploads it,

41
00:02:24,966 --> 00:02:27,958
notebook B 把它的 run 实时传到 W&B
and notebook B streams its runs to W&B.

42
00:02:28,278 --> 00:02:33,801
下面是 repo 这条线：你的笔记本打包代码，bucket 存着它
Below, the repo lane: your laptop packs the code, a bucket holds it,

43
00:02:33,801 --> 00:02:37,537
Vertex AI 运行它，这个 run 向 W&B 汇报
Vertex AI runs it, and the run reports to W&B.

44
00:02:37,857 --> 00:02:39,457
今天两条线都点亮
Today we light both.

45
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:46,096
从课程页面打开 notebook A，另存一份，把运行时切到 GPU
Open notebook A from the course page, save a copy, and switch the runtime to a GPU;

46
00:02:46,096 --> 00:02:47,696
暂停一下，把它配好
pause and set it up.

47
00:02:47,916 --> 00:02:52,311
它保存下来的输出，是授课老师在一块 Tesla T4 上的那次运行
Its stored outputs show the instructors' run on one Tesla T4.

48
00:02:53,667 --> 00:02:55,606
跑数据集的单元格
Run the dataset cells:

49
00:02:55,606 --> 00:03:01,070
1156 张照片，来自一个 GitHub release，有四个奶酪 label
1,156 photos from one GitHub release, with four cheese labels.

50
00:03:01,390 --> 00:03:02,940
记住它们的顺序
Remember their order.

51
00:03:02,990 --> 00:03:09,987
然后是划分：936 张用来训练，104 张用来验证，116 张用来测试
Then the split: 936 to train, 104 to validate, 116 to test.

52
00:03:10,307 --> 00:03:11,750
暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
Pause and run them.

53
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,400
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

54
00:03:13,464 --> 00:03:18,151
这个单元格把 validation percent 设成 0.2
The cell sets validation_percent to 0.2,

55
00:03:18,151 --> 00:03:22,253
可验证集只有 1156 张里的 104 张
yet validation is 104 out of 1,156.

56
00:03:22,573 --> 00:03:24,323
这段代码实际上做了什么？
What did the code actually do?

57
00:03:33,167 --> 00:03:35,130
两次划分用的都是 test percent
Both splits use test_percent.

58
00:03:35,450 --> 00:03:39,840
1156 的 10% 是 116 张，用来测试
10 percent of 1,156 is 116 for testing,

59
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:47,268
剩下 1040 张的 10% 是 104 张，也就是验证集
then 10 percent of the remaining 1,040 is 104, the validation set.

60
00:03:47,588 --> 00:03:50,447
一个小疏漏，还被复制进了 repo 的训练脚本
A small slip, copied into the repo trainer.

61
00:03:50,683 --> 00:03:52,461
现在看自己动手做的实验追踪工具
Now the home-made tracker.

62
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:56,592
第 31 个单元格建了一个目录，用当前的 Unix 时间命名
Cell 31 makes a folder named after the current Unix time.

63
00:03:56,912 --> 00:03:58,514
每个模型训练完
After each model trains,

64
00:03:58,514 --> 00:04:03,386
第 12 个单元格里的辅助函数就往目录里放五个文件
the helper from cell 12 drops five files into it: the model, its weights,

65
00:04:03,386 --> 00:04:06,256
模型、权重、结构、训练历史和指标
its structure, its history and its metrics.

66
00:04:06,576 --> 00:04:08,582
暂停一下，把五个模型训练一遍
Pause and train the five models.

67
00:04:09,367 --> 00:04:12,913
第 54 个单元格把指标文件汇总成一张表
Cell 54 gathers the metric files into one table,

68
00:04:12,913 --> 00:04:16,459
第 56 个单元格把第一行当成最好的模型
and cell 56 picks its top row as the best model;

69
00:04:16,459 --> 00:04:19,266
暂停一下，一直跑到预测那几个单元格
pause and run through the predictions.

70
00:04:19,586 --> 00:04:25,332
有一个小疏漏：准确率在排序前变成了文本，所以按字符串排序
A small slip: accuracy becomes text before sorting, so it sorts strings;

71
00:04:25,332 --> 00:04:28,524
9.5% 会排在 68% 前面
9.5 percent would rank above 68 percent.

72
00:04:28,767 --> 00:04:30,367
先给第一个答案
Here is a first answer.

73
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:36,191
这个目录存了设置和分数，却没存哪 116 张照片是测试集
The folder keeps settings and scores, but not which 116 photos were the test set.

74
00:04:36,511 --> 00:04:41,460
划分没有随机种子，所以每次运行都拿不同的 116 张来评分
The split has no seed, so every run is graded on a different 116.

75
00:04:41,780 --> 00:04:44,326
一张照片值 0.86 个百分点
One photo is worth 0.86 points,

76
00:04:44,326 --> 00:04:48,351
而 notebook A 的冠军只领先两张照片
and the winner in notebook A leads by two photos.

77
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,403
用第 62 个单元格登录
Sign in with cell 62,

78
00:04:50,403 --> 00:04:54,140
在第 63 个单元格里填上你自己的项目和 bucket
put your own project and bucket into cell 63,

79
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:55,740
再跑第 66 个单元格
and run cell 66.

80
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,549
你的任何一个 bucket 都行
Any bucket of yours works;

81
00:04:57,549 --> 00:05:02,253
要是还没有，先跳过这次上传，等准备工作那一章建好再回来
if you have none yet, skip this upload and come back after the setup chapter.

82
00:05:02,573 --> 00:05:03,995
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

83
00:05:04,045 --> 00:05:07,579
金色标签：这些文件现在放在你的 bucket 里
A gold tag: those files now sit in your bucket,

84
00:05:07,579 --> 00:05:11,640
每个模型 10 到 104 MB 的权重，外加一份拷贝
10 to 104 megabytes of weights per model, plus a copy.

85
00:05:12,683 --> 00:05:14,752
Notebook B 加上了 W&B
Notebook B adds W&B.

86
00:05:15,072 --> 00:05:19,638
它的第一个单元格安装 W&B，-U 参数的意思是装最新版
Its first cell installs it, and the -U flag means whatever is newest.

87
00:05:19,958 --> 00:05:24,226
在我们没有登录的替身里额外检查一下
An extra check in our signed-out stand-in shows

88
00:05:24,226 --> 00:05:30,219
录制时是 0.31.0，而保存下来的那次运行用的是 0.22.2
0.31.0 at the time of recording, while the stored run used 0.22.2.

89
00:05:30,539 --> 00:05:31,883
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

90
00:05:31,933 --> 00:05:35,933
数据相关的单元格，一直到第 32 个，都和 notebook A 一样
The data cells, through cell 32, match notebook A,

91
00:05:35,933 --> 00:05:41,213
但其中一个还会下载一个 zip 包，大约 510 MB，你根本用不上
but one also downloads a zip of about 510 megabytes you never use.

92
00:05:41,533 --> 00:05:44,413
你可以删掉那一行，然后暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
You may delete that line; then pause and run them.

93
00:05:44,650 --> 00:05:48,703
在 W&B 的 User Settings 里复制你的 API key
Copy your API key from the user settings on W&B.

94
00:05:49,023 --> 00:05:52,270
在 Colab 里打开钥匙图标，添加一个 secret
In Colab, open the key icon and add a secret

95
00:05:52,270 --> 00:05:56,106
名字和画面上一字不差，并打开 Notebook access
named exactly as on screen, with notebook access on.

96
00:05:56,426 --> 00:05:58,026
暂停一下，加上你自己的
Pause and add yours.

97
00:05:58,133 --> 00:06:00,074
第 34 个单元格用它登录
Cell 34 signs in with it.

98
00:06:00,316 --> 00:06:02,812
现在暂停一下，把五个训练单元格跑一遍
Now pause and run the five training cells.

99
00:06:03,132 --> 00:06:05,666
每个单元格都用 wandb.init 开启自己的 run
Each starts its run with wandb.init in one project,

100
00:06:05,666 --> 00:06:07,593
都在同一个项目 cheese-app-demo 里
cheese-app-demo.

101
00:06:07,868 --> 00:06:12,690
在账本里，这五行变成了五个 run，共用一条 epoch 轴
In the ledger, the five rows become five runs on one shared epoch axis.

102
00:06:12,933 --> 00:06:15,216
可是只有 2 block 那个 run 有曲线
But only the 2_block run shows curves.

103
00:06:15,536 --> 00:06:18,138
把它的 model.fit 调用和另一个单元格的比一比
Compare its model.fit call with another cell's.

104
00:06:18,458 --> 00:06:21,146
来想一个问题：另外四个缺了什么？
Something to ponder: what do the other four lack?

105
00:06:27,983 --> 00:06:31,695
一个 callback：model.fit 在每个 epoch 之后调用的代码
A callback: code that model.fit calls after every epoch.

106
00:06:32,015 --> 00:06:35,604
只有 2 block 那个单元格传了 W&B 的 callback
Only the 2_block cell passes the W&B callback,

107
00:06:35,604 --> 00:06:39,738
所以只有它的 loss 和准确率一个 epoch 一个 epoch 地传过来
so only its loss and accuracy arrive, epoch by epoch.

108
00:06:40,058 --> 00:06:44,239
没有 callback，wandb.init 只给你系统图表，从不给你的曲线
Without one, wandb.init gives you system charts, never your curves.

109
00:06:44,483 --> 00:06:48,920
两个 MobileNet 的 run 名字一样，所以要靠 run ID 区分
Both MobileNet runs share one name, so tell them apart by run ID.

110
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,481
没有哪个单元格结束最后一个 run
No cell finishes the last run,

111
00:06:51,481 --> 00:06:54,766
所以在第 52 个单元格后面加上 wandb.finish，这是额外步骤
so add wandb.finish after cell 52, an extra.

112
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:59,105
第 55 个单元格生成了开头的第二张表
Cell 55 builds the second table from the opening.

113
00:06:59,425 --> 00:07:02,720
微调过的 MobileNet 在这里训练了 10 个 epoch
The fine-tuned MobileNet trained 10 epochs here

114
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:05,804
在 notebook A 里是 15 个：这不是公平的比较
and 15 in notebook A: not a fair comparison.

115
00:07:06,124 --> 00:07:12,343
再看冻结的 MobileNet，设置和 epoch 都一样
Now the frozen MobileNet, with the same settings and epochs:

116
00:07:12,343 --> 00:07:15,660
notebook A 里是 67.24，这里是 68.97
67.24 in notebook A, 68.97 here.

117
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:20,268
光凭运气就差了两张照片：正好是冠军领先的差距
Two photos apart by chance alone: the size of the winning margin.

118
00:07:20,516 --> 00:07:27,071
要上传的话，改第 13 个单元格里的 bucket 和项目并重跑它
To upload, edit the bucket and project inside cell 13 and run cell 13 again,

119
00:07:27,071 --> 00:07:29,227
然后跑第 64 和第 66 个单元格
then run cells 64 and 66;

120
00:07:29,227 --> 00:07:30,827
暂停一下，照着做
pause and do it.

121
00:07:35,150 --> 00:07:39,715
课上把这个写法画成三行，包在不变的训练代码外面
The lecture shows the pattern as three lines around unchanged training code.

122
00:07:40,035 --> 00:07:41,977
用 wandb.init 开启 run
Start the run with wandb.init.

123
00:07:42,297 --> 00:07:45,454
在 model.fit 里用 callback 盯住模型
Watch the model with a callback inside model.fit.

124
00:07:45,774 --> 00:07:47,715
最后在训练结束时结束这个 run
And finish the run when training ends.

125
00:07:47,950 --> 00:07:49,906
现在看 notebook B 里真正的单元格
Now notebook B's real cell.

126
00:07:50,126 --> 00:07:54,093
它先开启 run，然后把一个字典赋给 wandb.config
It starts the run, then assigns a dictionary to wandb.config,

127
00:07:54,093 --> 00:07:56,825
给 run 改名，再调用 wandb.run.save
renames the run, and calls wandb.run.save.

128
00:07:57,067 --> 00:07:58,667
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

129
00:07:58,731 --> 00:08:02,869
经过这次赋值，再加上后面用执行时间做的一次 update
After that assignment, and a later update with the execution time,

130
00:08:02,869 --> 00:08:04,875
这个 run 的 config 里有什么？
what does the run's config hold?

131
00:08:13,717 --> 00:08:15,075
盯住这个名字
Watch the name.

132
00:08:15,125 --> 00:08:16,444
调用 wandb.init
The call wandb.init

133
00:08:16,444 --> 00:08:20,330
会让 wandb.config 这个名字指向这个 run 的 config 抽屉
points the name wandb.config at the run's config drawer.

134
00:08:20,650 --> 00:08:23,105
这次赋值并没有装满那个抽屉
The assignment does not fill that drawer;

135
00:08:23,105 --> 00:08:25,920
它把名字挪到了一个新的、散落在外的字典上
it moves the name onto a new, loose dictionary.

136
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:31,167
接着 update 写进的是那个散落的字典，run 结束时抽屉还是空的
The update then writes into the loose one, and the run finishes with its drawer empty.

137
00:08:31,417 --> 00:08:35,961
证据：用今天的 W&B，开离线模式，作为我们的替身
The proof, on today's W&B in offline mode, as our stand-in.

138
00:08:36,281 --> 00:08:39,993
这个名字指向一个普通的 dict，而 run 的 config 是空的
The name points at a plain dict, and the run's config is empty.

139
00:08:40,313 --> 00:08:43,953
修法是把这个字典直接传给 wandb.init
The fix passes the dictionary to wandb.init itself,

140
00:08:43,953 --> 00:08:48,163
这样 config 里就有全部四个键，再加上执行时间
and the config holds all four keys plus the execution time.

141
00:08:51,650 --> 00:08:54,291
调用 wandb.run.save 加上 test 这个词
The call wandb.run.save with the word test

142
00:08:54,291 --> 00:08:56,051
会上传名字匹配 test 的文件
uploads files matching test;

143
00:08:56,051 --> 00:08:57,651
它并不保存这个 run
it does not save the run.

144
00:08:57,867 --> 00:09:01,737
这个 repo 的训练脚本把第一行和最后一行写对了
The repo's trainer gets the first and last lines right:

145
00:09:01,737 --> 00:09:05,184
config 放在 wandb.init 里，然后是 update 和 finish
config inside wandb.init, then update and finish.

146
00:09:05,504 --> 00:09:07,104
可中间那一行没了
But the middle line is gone.

147
00:09:07,424 --> 00:09:12,822
2025 年 10 月的一次 commit 删掉了这个 callback，没说原因
One commit in October 2025 removed the callback, without saying why.

148
00:09:13,142 --> 00:09:17,133
所以它的 run 有 config 和系统图表，没有曲线
So its runs get config and system charts, and no curves;

149
00:09:17,133 --> 00:09:19,627
练习 1 会把 callback 加回去
exercise 1 adds the callback again.

150
00:09:20,667 --> 00:09:23,472
课的后半部分讲 Vertex AI
The second half of the lecture is Vertex AI,

151
00:09:23,472 --> 00:09:26,086
也就是 Google Cloud 的机器学习平台
Google Cloud's machine learning platform.

152
00:09:26,406 --> 00:09:30,021
控制台里有三个入口要紧：Workbench 管 notebook
Three console entries matter: Workbench for notebooks,

153
00:09:30,021 --> 00:09:33,168
Training 管任务，Pipelines 管工作流
Training for jobs, and Pipelines for workflows.

154
00:09:33,488 --> 00:09:36,690
今天用的是 Training，在 Custom jobs 标签页上
Today is Training, on the custom jobs tab;

155
00:09:36,690 --> 00:09:38,672
第 15 讲用 Pipelines
lecture 15 uses Pipelines.

156
00:09:38,917 --> 00:09:42,906
无服务器训练的意思是：只在训练这一步租用硬件
Serverless training means you rent the hardware only for the training step.

157
00:09:43,226 --> 00:09:46,896
没人去搭服务器，计费在这一步结束时就停了
Nobody sets up a server, and billing stops when the step ends.

158
00:09:47,216 --> 00:09:50,586
机器还是有的，你只是不用管它的生命周期
There is still a machine; you just don't manage its lifetime.

159
00:09:50,834 --> 00:09:54,173
第一步：把 notebook 里的代码搬进一个 Python 文件
Step one: move the notebook code into a Python file,

160
00:09:54,173 --> 00:09:56,935
再把写死的选项改成命令行参数
and turn its hard-coded choices into flags.

161
00:09:57,255 --> 00:10:00,693
这些参数是 epoch 数、batch 大小和模型名
The flags are epochs, batch size and model name,

162
00:10:00,693 --> 00:10:03,058
再加上 train base 和你的 W&B 密钥
plus train_base and your W&B key.

163
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:07,576
第二步把这个文件打成一个 tar 包，也就是一个压缩归档文件
Step two packs that file into a tarball, one compressed archive,

164
00:10:07,576 --> 00:10:09,380
再上传到一个 bucket
and uploads it to a bucket.

165
00:10:09,700 --> 00:10:15,165
第三步在课上叫作 Model Trainer CLI Container 的地方运行
Step three runs from what the lecture calls the Model Trainer CLI Container,

166
00:10:15,165 --> 00:10:19,193
也就是你笔记本上的驾驶舱：它向 Vertex AI 申请一个任务
our cockpit on your laptop: it asks Vertex AI for a job.

167
00:10:19,513 --> 00:10:24,420
然后 Vertex AI 启动一台机器，只有 CPU，或者带一块 T4
Vertex AI then starts a machine, CPU only or with one T4.

168
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:28,858
它加载 Google 预构建的 TensorFlow image，安装你的 tar 包
It loads Google's prebuilt TensorFlow image, installs your tarball,

169
00:10:28,858 --> 00:10:32,484
用你的参数运行你的训练脚本，然后删掉这台机器
runs your trainer with your flags, and deletes the machine.

170
00:10:32,734 --> 00:10:35,017
有两个事实决定了后面的一切
Two facts drive everything after this.

171
00:10:35,337 --> 00:10:39,245
任务看不到你的笔记本：它的数据来自网上
The job cannot see your laptop: its data comes from the internet,

172
00:10:39,245 --> 00:10:42,974
任何要留下来的东西都必须写到某个持久的地方
and anything it should keep must be written somewhere durable.

173
00:10:43,294 --> 00:10:45,704
而且 image 是 Google 的，不是你的
And the image is Google's, not yours.

174
00:10:45,950 --> 00:10:47,500
快速预测一下
A quick prediction.

175
00:10:47,550 --> 00:10:50,878
你的笔记本没有 GPU，也没有 TensorFlow
Your laptop has no GPU and no TensorFlow.

176
00:10:51,198 --> 00:10:54,782
这张图里，哪些机器会 import TensorFlow？
Which machines in this picture will ever import TensorFlow?

177
00:10:59,617 --> 00:11:04,353
两个：Colab 运行时，以及每个 Vertex 任务里的 container
Two: the Colab runtime, and the container inside each Vertex job.

178
00:11:04,673 --> 00:11:08,449
从来不是你笔记本上的驾驶舱；讲 tar 包的那一章会证明这一点
Never the cockpit on your laptop; the tarball chapter proves it.

179
00:11:09,483 --> 00:11:12,352
把 model-training 这个 repo clone 下来，再进去
Clone the model-training repo and move into it;

180
00:11:12,352 --> 00:11:13,742
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
pause and run it.

181
00:11:13,792 --> 00:11:16,909
两个额外检查显示课程 pin 住的版本，以及 repo 里的文件
Two extras show the course pin and the repo's files.

182
00:11:24,316 --> 00:11:27,687
在控制台里启用 Vertex AI API
In the console, enable the Vertex AI API.

183
00:11:28,007 --> 00:11:31,484
然后申请 GPU 配额，也就是每个区域的额度
Then request GPU quota, an allowance per region.

184
00:11:31,804 --> 00:11:35,984
筛选 custom model training，选 T4 GPU
Filter for custom model training, pick T4 GPUs,

185
00:11:35,984 --> 00:11:39,451
包含 us-central1，也就是 cli.sh 运行的区域
include us-central1, where cli.sh runs,

186
00:11:39,451 --> 00:11:41,852
设一个新的上限，然后提交
set a new limit and submit.

187
00:11:42,172 --> 00:11:43,722
暂停一下，两件都做了
Pause and do both.

188
00:11:43,772 --> 00:11:47,313
审批可能要好几个小时，也可能被拒
Approval may take hours or be refused;

189
00:11:47,313 --> 00:11:50,108
cli.sh 没有配额也能在 CPU 上跑
cli.sh runs on CPU without it.

190
00:11:50,350 --> 00:11:54,257
接下来，在 repo 旁边建一个 secrets 目录，绝不放在里面
Next, a secrets folder beside the repo, never inside it;

191
00:11:54,257 --> 00:11:55,857
暂停一下，建好它
pause and make it.

192
00:11:58,866 --> 00:12:03,164
然后是身份：一个叫 model-trainer 的服务账号
Then the identity: a service account model-trainer

193
00:12:03,164 --> 00:12:06,345
角色是 Storage Admin、AI Platform Admin
with Storage Admin, AI Platform Admin

194
00:12:06,345 --> 00:12:08,752
和 Vertex AI Administrator
and Vertex AI Administrator,

195
00:12:08,752 --> 00:12:13,565
再在 secrets 里存一个 JSON 密钥：model-trainer.json
and one JSON key saved in secrets as model-trainer.json.

196
00:12:13,885 --> 00:12:15,485
暂停一下，建一个你自己的
Pause and create yours.

197
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:20,807
如实说一句
One honest note.

198
00:12:20,857 --> 00:12:24,763
这台录制用的机器没有 Google 凭据
This recording machine has no Google credentials,

199
00:12:24,763 --> 00:12:27,791
没有 W&B 账号，没有 GPU，也没有浏览器
no W&B account, no GPU and no browser.

200
00:12:28,111 --> 00:12:31,900
列表里的那个密钥是一个明显无效的替身
The key in that listing is an obviously invalid stand-in,

201
00:12:31,900 --> 00:12:34,425
在 container 启动之前就被移走了
moved out before the container starts.

202
00:12:34,745 --> 00:12:38,470
所以每个云端步骤都展示放错位置的密钥会带来的失败
So each cloud step shows the failure a misplaced key gives,

203
00:12:38,470 --> 00:12:40,868
成功的结果都注明出处
and successes come from named sources.

204
00:12:41,116 --> 00:12:44,529
然后用你自己的名字建一个 bucket；暂停一下，建好它
Then create a bucket with your own name; pause and create it.

205
00:12:44,849 --> 00:12:49,894
两个额外检查说明了原因：我们的占位名返回 404，它根本不存在
Two extras show why: our placeholder returns 404, it exists nowhere,

206
00:12:49,894 --> 00:12:54,641
而 README 里的名字返回 401，它属于别人
while the README's name returns 401, it belongs to someone else.

207
00:12:54,961 --> 00:12:59,015
金色标签：这个 bucket 存着你的代码和实验目录
A gold tag: the bucket stores your code and experiment folders.

208
00:12:59,250 --> 00:13:00,842
最后，复制你的 W&B 密钥
Last, copy your W&B key

209
00:13:00,842 --> 00:13:04,925
在起 container 要用的那个终端里 export 它
and export it in the terminal you'll use for the container.

210
00:13:05,245 --> 00:13:06,688
暂停一下，照着做
Pause and do it.

211
00:13:06,738 --> 00:13:10,471
额外用 echo 打印它的长度，我们的占位密钥是 40
An extra echo prints its length, 40 for our placeholder.

212
00:13:10,791 --> 00:13:15,826
它不能是 0；训练脚本 pin 住的 wandb，只接受正好 40 个字符
It must not be zero, and the trainer's pinned wandb accepts exactly 40.

213
00:13:16,146 --> 00:13:18,800
如果你的长度不一样，先继续往下做
If yours is a different length, keep going,

214
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:23,058
但提交任务之前，要先看“谁提交，谁运行”那一章
but watch the chapter Who submits, who runs, before you submit a job.

215
00:13:24,133 --> 00:13:25,733
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

216
00:13:25,797 --> 00:13:29,573
你 export 了密钥，关掉那个终端，又开了一个新的
You exported the key, closed that terminal, and opened a new one.

217
00:13:29,893 --> 00:13:31,792
同样的 echo 现在会打印什么？
What does the same echo print now?

218
00:13:38,633 --> 00:13:43,156
0：export 过的变量，只存在于那个 shell 和它的子进程里
Zero: an exported variable exists only in that shell and its children.

219
00:13:43,476 --> 00:13:46,932
第一部分完成了：密钥设好了，bucket 也有名字了
Part 1 is done: the key is set, the bucket has a name.

220
00:13:47,252 --> 00:13:50,366
接下来我们构建驾驶舱，而今天它构建不了
Next, we build the cockpit, and today it won't build.

221
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:57,000
第二部分要把训练脚本送出去：构建驾驶舱，打包代码，发一个任务
Part 2 ships the trainer: build the cockpit, pack the code, send one job.

222
00:13:57,320 --> 00:14:02,203
把你的 bucket 和项目填进 docker-shell.sh 第 8、9 行
Put your bucket and project on lines 8 and 9 of docker-shell.sh;

223
00:14:02,203 --> 00:14:03,805
暂停一下，改成你自己的
pause and edit yours.

224
00:14:05,050 --> 00:14:09,445
有一个小疏漏：README 里贴的这份脚本，不是真正的文件
A small slip: the README's copy of this script is not the real file.

225
00:14:09,765 --> 00:14:13,467
它有方括号里的注释，还有一行旧写法是给 Apple 芯片用的
It has notes in brackets and an older line for Apple chips,

226
00:14:13,467 --> 00:14:15,098
所以要改脚本文件本身
so edit the script itself.

227
00:14:15,418 --> 00:14:19,557
它按 amd64 构建，并挂载你的代码和 secrets
It builds for amd64 and mounts your code and secrets.

228
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:23,527
现在在 repo 里面跑 sh docker-shell.sh
Now run sh docker-shell.sh from inside the repo;

229
00:14:23,527 --> 00:14:25,127
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
pause and run it.

230
00:14:25,347 --> 00:14:27,672
今天它在 14 步里的第 2 步就失败了
Today it fails at step 2 of 14.

231
00:14:27,992 --> 00:14:32,774
全部 22 个包都从 Debian 软件源返回 404 Not Found
All 22 packages return 404 Not Found from the Debian mirror,

232
00:14:32,774 --> 00:14:35,245
构建停在第 18 行
and the build stops at line 18.

233
00:14:35,565 --> 00:14:37,961
脚本里的 set -e，也就是出错就退出
The script's set -e, exit on error,

234
00:14:37,961 --> 00:14:40,152
于是在 docker run 之前就把它停下了
then stops it before docker run.

235
00:14:40,400 --> 00:14:42,000
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

236
00:14:42,064 --> 00:14:46,416
每条报错都是 Debian 软件源返回的 404，而你的网络是通的
Every error says 404 from the Debian mirror, and your internet works.

237
00:14:46,736 --> 00:14:49,211
Dockerfile 的哪一行决定了你的 Debian？
Which line of the Dockerfile picks your Debian?

238
00:14:58,050 --> 00:14:59,650
第 2 行，FROM 那一行
Line 2, the FROM line.

239
00:14:59,885 --> 00:15:01,552
代号 bullseye 就是 Debian 11
Bullseye is Debian 11,

240
00:15:01,552 --> 00:15:08,546
录制时它的安全更新源列出的包已经不再提供，这些包搬到了归档源
and at the time of recording its security mirror lists packages it no longer serves; they moved to an archive.

241
00:15:08,866 --> 00:15:10,496
第一处修复，是额外步骤
The first fix, an extra,

242
00:15:10,496 --> 00:15:12,267
把 base image 换成 bookworm
switches the base to bookworm,

243
00:15:12,267 --> 00:15:14,434
也就是 Debian 12；暂停一下，改好它
Debian 12; pause and make it.

244
00:15:14,783 --> 00:15:16,383
暂停一下，再跑一遍
Pause and run it again.

245
00:15:16,575 --> 00:15:18,433
这次它停在第 8 步
Now it stops at step 8:

246
00:15:18,433 --> 00:15:22,229
google-cloud-sdk 报 no installation candidate
google-cloud-sdk has no installation candidate,

247
00:15:22,229 --> 00:15:24,895
取而代之的是 google-cloud-cli
and google-cloud-cli replaces it.

248
00:15:25,215 --> 00:15:27,178
Google 给它的 apt 包改了名
Google renamed its apt package.

249
00:15:27,417 --> 00:15:33,640
第二处修复，也是额外步骤：在第 37 行改装 google-cloud-cli
The second fix, also an extra: install google-cloud-cli instead, on line 37;

250
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:35,240
暂停一下，改好它
pause and make it.

251
00:15:35,460 --> 00:15:38,468
额外跑一下 git diff，能看到你改过的全部内容
An extra git diff shows everything you changed:

252
00:15:38,468 --> 00:15:41,603
你填的两个值，两处修复，没有别的
your two values, the two fixes, and nothing else.

253
00:15:41,850 --> 00:15:46,806
暂停一下，跑第三遍：它构建成功了，这里大约 5 分钟
Pause and run it a third time: it builds, about 5 minutes here,

254
00:15:46,806 --> 00:15:50,661
在 Apple Silicon 上更久，因为 amd64 要模拟运行
longer on Apple Silicon, where amd64 is emulated.

255
00:15:50,981 --> 00:15:54,300
横幅显示它在运行，接着 gcloud 打不开密钥文件
The banner says running, then gcloud cannot open the key file:

256
00:15:54,300 --> 00:15:55,900
这是我们缺的那把密钥
our missing key.

257
00:15:56,101 --> 00:15:59,130
换成你的密钥，这一行会确认服务账号
With yours, this line confirms the service account.

258
00:15:59,450 --> 00:16:03,887
脚本照样往下走，因为 entrypoint 里没有 set -e
The script carries on anyway, because the entrypoint has no set -e.

259
00:16:04,133 --> 00:16:09,701
架构是 x86 64，在 Mac 上也一样；版本号都在画面上
The architecture is x86_64, on a Mac too; the versions are on screen.

260
00:16:10,021 --> 00:16:14,004
有一个小疏漏：activated 是在激活之前打印的
A small slip: activated is printed before the activation,

261
00:16:14,004 --> 00:16:15,604
只是一句话，不是事实
a label, not a fact.

262
00:16:17,150 --> 00:16:19,774
在驾驶舱里做几个额外检查
Inside the cockpit, a few extra checks.

263
00:16:20,094 --> 00:16:22,675
/secrets 是空的，这是我们的沙盒
/secrets is empty, our sandbox.

264
00:16:22,995 --> 00:16:28,286
项目、bucket 和密钥都传进来了；gcloud、gsutil 和 uv 都在
Project, bucket and key came through; gcloud, gsutil and uv are here.

265
00:16:28,606 --> 00:16:30,191
暂停一下，检查你的
Pause and check yours:

266
00:16:30,191 --> 00:16:34,296
最后那个数，对这个 wandb pin 应该是 40，绝不能是 0
the last number should be 40 for this wandb pin, never 0;

267
00:16:34,296 --> 00:16:37,609
如果不是，去看“谁提交，谁运行”那一章
if not, see the chapter Who submits, who runs.

268
00:16:37,929 --> 00:16:40,104
可是 import TensorFlow 失败了
But importing TensorFlow fails:

269
00:16:40,104 --> 00:16:43,262
这个 container 只提交任务，从不训练
this container submits jobs, it never trains.

270
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:48,923
先看 setup.py；暂停一下，打开它
Review setup.py; pause and open it.

271
00:16:49,243 --> 00:16:52,507
它就是 pip 安装 tar 包时看的铭牌
It is the label pip uses to install the tarball.

272
00:16:52,827 --> 00:16:58,501
唯一声明的依赖是 wandb，pin 在 0.15.11
The only declared dependency is wandb, pinned to 0.15.11.

273
00:16:58,821 --> 00:17:02,346
它的 find packages 调用能找到 trainer 目录
Its find_packages() call finds the trainer folder

274
00:17:02,346 --> 00:17:06,805
因为这个目录有自己的 init 文件，所以装好之后
because the folder has its own __init__.py, so once installed,

275
00:17:06,805 --> 00:17:08,891
python -m trainer.task 就能跑
python -m trainer.task works.

276
00:17:09,211 --> 00:17:12,033
TensorFlow 和 scikit-learn 都没有声明
TensorFlow and scikit-learn are not declared:

277
00:17:12,033 --> 00:17:15,546
默认它们来自 Google 提供的 image
they are assumed to come from the image Google provides,

278
00:17:15,546 --> 00:17:18,619
后面有一章会看到 tar 包里没有它们
and a later chapter shows the tarball lacks them.

279
00:17:18,939 --> 00:17:21,947
而 requests 只是因为 wandb 需要它才被带进来的
Requests only arrives because wandb needs it.

280
00:17:22,183 --> 00:17:25,383
接着看 task.py；暂停一下，打开它
Review task.py next; pause and open it.

281
00:17:25,703 --> 00:17:27,870
现在 notebook 里的选项都成了命令行参数
The notebook choices are flags now,

282
00:17:27,870 --> 00:17:31,804
而密钥参数默认是文本 16：记住这一点
and the --wandb_key flag defaults to the text 16: remember that.

283
00:17:32,124 --> 00:17:37,613
数据来自一个 GitHub release，因为任务看不到你的笔记本
The data comes from one GitHub release, since the job cannot see your laptop,

284
00:17:37,613 --> 00:17:40,679
而 W&B 的登录在下载之后才运行
and the W&B login runs after that download.

285
00:17:40,917 --> 00:17:45,540
现在打包：在 container 里跑 sh package-trainer.sh
Now pack it: run sh package-trainer.sh inside the container;

286
00:17:45,540 --> 00:17:47,140
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
pause and run it.

287
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:50,292
命令 tar 列出了八个条目，而上传失败了
Tar lists eight entries, and the upload fails:

288
00:17:50,292 --> 00:17:52,714
我们的占位 bucket 并不存在
our placeholder bucket does not exist.

289
00:17:53,034 --> 00:17:57,194
第 4 行用的是固定的文件名，所以每次上传都会覆盖上一次
Line 4 uses a fixed name, so each upload overwrites the last.

290
00:17:58,033 --> 00:18:01,553
额外检查：这个 tar 包是 4016 字节
Extra checks: the tarball is 4,016 bytes.

291
00:18:01,873 --> 00:18:06,261
在我们的 Linux 引擎上，它属于 root，因为是 container 写的
On our Linux engine it belongs to root, because the container wrote it;

292
00:18:06,261 --> 00:18:08,017
在 Docker Desktop 上，它属于你
on Docker Desktop, to you.

293
00:18:08,337 --> 00:18:10,026
不管哪种情况，Git 都会忽略它
Git ignores it either way.

294
00:18:10,267 --> 00:18:11,867
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

295
00:18:11,931 --> 00:18:14,128
你改了 task.py 里的一个错字
You fix a typo in task.py.

296
00:18:14,448 --> 00:18:18,117
你是重新构建 image，再跑一次打包脚本，还是两个都做？
Do you rebuild the image, run the package script again, or both?

297
00:18:24,967 --> 00:18:26,567
只要重跑打包脚本
Only the package script.

298
00:18:26,823 --> 00:18:29,675
Vertex AI 运行的是你 bucket 里的 tar 包
Vertex AI runs the tarball in your bucket,

299
00:18:29,675 --> 00:18:31,644
你的 image 从来不会被带过去
and your image never travels.

300
00:18:31,964 --> 00:18:35,676
驾驶舱挂载了你的代码目录，所以已经能看到这次修改
The cockpit mounts your code folder, so it already sees the edit.

301
00:18:35,996 --> 00:18:40,007
金色标签：tar 包存在你的 bucket 里，而且很小
A gold tag: the tarball is stored in your bucket, and it is tiny.

302
00:18:41,650 --> 00:18:44,935
再看 cli.sh；暂停一下，打开它
Review cli.sh; pause and open it.

303
00:18:45,255 --> 00:18:47,829
它用随机的十六进制串给任务命名
It names the job with random hex,

304
00:18:47,829 --> 00:18:52,274
申请一台 n1-standard-4 机器，并设定一个 GPU image
asks for one n1-standard-4 machine, and sets a GPU image.

305
00:18:52,594 --> 00:18:56,955
然后它指向 bucket 里你的 tar 包和要运行的模块
Then it points at your tarball in the bucket and the module to run,

306
00:18:56,955 --> 00:19:00,274
再拼出参数，最后是你的 W&B 密钥
and builds the arguments, ending with your W&B key.

307
00:19:00,517 --> 00:19:04,074
再往下，GPU 那一段被注释掉了
Further down, the GPU block is commented out

308
00:19:04,074 --> 00:19:09,328
第 31 行换成 CPU image，所以只有 CPU 那条命令会运行
and line 31 swaps in the CPU image, so only the CPU command runs.

309
00:19:09,648 --> 00:19:13,584
有一个小疏漏：README 先讲 GPU
A small slip: the README shows GPU first and CPU

310
00:19:13,584 --> 00:19:17,519
把 CPU 写成可选，可这个脚本本来就在 CPU 上跑
as optional, but the script already runs on CPU.

311
00:19:17,767 --> 00:19:21,647
先看金色标签：一旦任务的机器分配好
A gold tag first: once the job's machine is provisioned,

312
00:19:21,647 --> 00:19:24,487
你的项目就一直付费，直到脚本退出
your project pays until the script exits.

313
00:19:24,807 --> 00:19:26,893
确认你的密钥长度是 40
Check that your key length is 40;

314
00:19:26,893 --> 00:19:31,506
如果不是，先看下一章“谁提交，谁运行”，再提交
if not, watch the next chapter, Who submits, who runs, before you submit.

315
00:19:31,826 --> 00:19:35,282
现在跑 sh cli.sh；暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Now sh cli.sh; pause and run it.

316
00:19:35,602 --> 00:19:40,615
第一行是真的：us-central1 的 Vertex AI endpoint
The first line is real: the Vertex AI endpoint in us-central1.

317
00:19:40,935 --> 00:19:44,316
然后它停下了，没有激活的账号，因为密钥从来没加载过
Then it stops with no active account, because the key

318
00:19:44,316 --> 00:19:47,186
额外跑一下 gcloud auth list，就能确认
never loaded; an extra auth list confirms it.

319
00:19:47,506 --> 00:19:50,983
换成你的密钥，gcloud 会报告任务已创建
With your key, gcloud reports the job as created.

320
00:19:51,217 --> 00:19:55,654
额外用 sh -x 跟踪一遍，能看到它想发出去的任务
An extra trace with sh -x shows the job it tried to send.

321
00:19:55,974 --> 00:20:00,113
GPU image 先被设好，然后被 CPU image 覆盖
The GPU image is set, then overridden by the CPU image.

322
00:20:00,433 --> 00:20:02,033
然后是完整的命令
Then the full command.

323
00:20:02,118 --> 00:20:05,326
这个 worker pool spec 就是这个任务的机器订单
The worker pool spec is the job's machine order:

324
00:20:05,326 --> 00:20:09,670
机器类型、一个副本，也就是一台机器，再加上 image 和模块
machine type, one replica, meaning one machine, image and module.

325
00:20:09,990 --> 00:20:14,513
最后是参数，结尾是明文的 W&B 密钥
Last come the arguments, ending with your W&B key in plain text.

326
00:20:14,967 --> 00:20:16,567
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

327
00:20:16,631 --> 00:20:20,386
你的 W&B 密钥现在成了任务参数的一部分
Your W&B key is now part of the job's arguments.

328
00:20:20,706 --> 00:20:22,306
以后谁能看到它？
Who can see it later?

329
00:20:30,867 --> 00:20:36,193
这个项目里能查看任务的任何人，因为任务规格会保存它的参数
Anyone who can view jobs in this project, because the job spec keeps its arguments,

330
00:20:36,193 --> 00:20:38,760
要是你直接敲在命令里，还有你的 shell 历史
plus your shell history if typed inline.

331
00:20:39,080 --> 00:20:42,403
用一把专用的密钥，结束时轮换掉
Use a dedicated key and rotate it at the end;

332
00:20:42,403 --> 00:20:44,840
练习里用的是 Secret Manager
the exercises use Secret Manager.

333
00:20:45,083 --> 00:20:49,264
另一种出错的方式：在一个从没 export 过密钥的终端里
The other way it goes wrong: a terminal where the key was never exported.

334
00:20:49,584 --> 00:20:54,107
进去之后，它的长度是 0，参数的结尾是一个空的密钥
Inside, its length is 0, and the arguments end with an empty key.

335
00:20:54,427 --> 00:20:58,544
所以任务会先下载数据，然后才在登录时失败
So the job would download its data, and only then fail at login.

336
00:20:58,864 --> 00:21:04,177
退出、export，再重新开始；先退出旧的驾驶舱，名字还被它占着
Exit, export, and start again; first exit any old cockpit, which holds the name.

337
00:21:05,767 --> 00:21:08,178
每个任务都有三枚徽章参与
Three badges take part in every job.

338
00:21:08,498 --> 00:21:12,252
第一枚是你的密钥文件，属于 model-trainer 这个服务账号
The first is your key file, for the model-trainer service account.

339
00:21:12,572 --> 00:21:16,967
它的三个角色让它能写你的 bucket、创建任务：它负责提交
Its three roles let it write to your bucket and create jobs: it submits.

340
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:21,498
第三枚是你的 W&B 密钥，进的完全是另一栋楼
The third is your W&B key, for a different building altogether,

341
00:21:21,498 --> 00:21:24,432
靠手动放进任务的参数里带过去
carried by hand inside the job's arguments.

342
00:21:24,752 --> 00:21:26,886
中间那根挂绳还空着
The middle lanyard is still empty.

343
00:21:27,134 --> 00:21:28,734
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

344
00:21:28,798 --> 00:21:32,220
任务从你的私有 bucket 安装你的包
The job installs your package from your private bucket,

345
00:21:32,220 --> 00:21:35,980
可你的密钥文件从没离开过你的笔记本。这是怎么做到的？
but your key file never left your laptop. How?

346
00:21:44,650 --> 00:21:48,757
第二枚徽章：你项目的 Vertex AI 服务代理
The second badge: your project's Vertex AI service agent,

347
00:21:48,757 --> 00:21:51,135
一个由 Google 管理的服务账号
a service account Google manages.

348
00:21:51,455 --> 00:21:56,405
任务默认以它的身份运行，它能打开同一个项目里的 bucket
By default the job runs as it, and it can open buckets in the same project.

349
00:21:56,725 --> 00:21:58,794
你的密钥只证明了是谁提交的
Your key only proved who submitted.

350
00:21:59,114 --> 00:22:01,995
如果任务访问你的 bucket 时报 403
If a job ever gets a 403 on your bucket,

351
00:22:01,995 --> 00:22:04,661
就要给这个身份授予访问权限
that is the identity to grant access.

352
00:22:05,300 --> 00:22:06,300
在 Vertex 上
On Vertex,

353
00:22:06,300 --> 00:22:09,993
任务的第一步是把你的 tar 包安装进 Google 的 image
the job's first step installs your tarball into Google's image.

354
00:22:10,313 --> 00:22:11,958
我们这里跑不了 Vertex
We can't run Vertex here,

355
00:22:11,958 --> 00:22:15,775
所以在笔记本上把这一步重跑一遍，标成替身
so we rerun that step on the laptop, tagged as a stand-in.

356
00:22:16,095 --> 00:22:19,270
在一个普通的 Python 3.10 container 里
In a plain Python 3.10 container,

357
00:22:19,270 --> 00:22:24,948
pip 安装这个 tar 包：你的包，加上 wandb 0.15.11
pip installs the tarball: your package, plus wandb 0.15.11.

358
00:22:25,184 --> 00:22:29,334
额外跑一下 pip list：有 wandb、requests 和它们的辅助依赖
An extra pip list shows wandb, requests and their helpers,

359
00:22:29,334 --> 00:22:32,053
但没有 TensorFlow，也没有 scikit-learn
but no TensorFlow and no scikit-learn.

360
00:22:32,373 --> 00:22:35,305
训练脚本指望预构建的 image 提供这些
The trainer counts on the prebuilt image for those,

361
00:22:35,305 --> 00:22:37,088
而我们没有把它拉下来检查
which we did not pull to check.

362
00:22:37,408 --> 00:22:40,266
没有它，训练脚本连帮助信息都打不出来
Without it, the trainer cannot even print its help.

363
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:47,547
然后是训练脚本里 W&B 的第一步，第 153 行，用三个密钥试一试
Then the trainer's first W&B step, line 153, with three keys.

364
00:22:47,867 --> 00:22:52,649
上一章那个空的密钥，报 api key not configured
The empty key from the last chapter fails with api_key not configured,

365
00:22:52,649 --> 00:22:57,637
而在 Vertex 上，这发生在数据下载之后，用的是计费的机器时间
and on Vertex that comes after the data download, on billed machine time.

366
00:22:57,957 --> 00:22:59,962
默认的 16 会失败，报
The default of 16 fails:

367
00:22:59,962 --> 00:23:03,973
API key must be 40 characters long, yours was 2
API key must be 40 characters long, yours was 2.

368
00:23:04,293 --> 00:23:09,200
我们 40 个字符的占位密钥，能通过离线的长度检查，仅此而已
Our 40 character placeholder passes the offline length check, and nothing more.

369
00:23:09,750 --> 00:23:12,164
还有一点：这个老的 wandb pin
One more: this old wandb pin

370
00:23:12,164 --> 00:23:15,958
只接受正好 40 个字符，47 个就会失败
accepts exactly 40 characters, and 47 fails.

371
00:23:16,278 --> 00:23:20,118
我们没法确认 W&B 现在发的密钥是什么格式
We could not check which key format W&B gives out today.

372
00:23:20,438 --> 00:23:24,641
如果你的不一样，这个 pin 会拒绝它，所以提交之前先检查
If yours differs, this pin refuses it, so check before you submit.

373
00:23:24,961 --> 00:23:26,927
有一个办法，这里没有测试过
One fix, untested here:

374
00:23:26,927 --> 00:23:31,459
把 setup.py 里 wandb 的 pin 升到当前的版本
raise the wandb pin in setup.py to a current release,

375
00:23:31,459 --> 00:23:35,649
再跑一次 sh package-trainer.sh，然后提交
run sh package-trainer.sh again, and then submit.

376
00:23:37,283 --> 00:23:39,513
要查看任务，打开 Vertex AI
To view jobs, open Vertex AI,

377
00:23:39,513 --> 00:23:41,974
再点 Training，再点 Custom jobs
then Training, then Custom jobs;

378
00:23:41,974 --> 00:23:43,896
暂停一下，找找你的
pause and look for yours.

379
00:23:44,216 --> 00:23:48,440
它是一个自定义任务，不是训练 pipeline，所以要去那个标签页找
It is a custom job, not a training pipeline, so look on that tab.

380
00:23:48,760 --> 00:23:51,330
打开你的任务，点它的日志链接
Open your job and follow its logs link;

381
00:23:51,330 --> 00:23:53,966
等那行 Training Job Complete 出现
wait for the line Training Job Complete.

382
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:55,800
任务会打印什么？
What will the job print?

383
00:23:55,928 --> 00:23:59,536
这期视频没有任何任务日志，所以这里给出的是它的样子
No job log exists for this video, so here is its shape,

384
00:23:59,536 --> 00:24:02,029
按代码自己的 print 语句拼出来的
built from the code's own print lines.

385
00:24:02,349 --> 00:24:06,104
这些数量是两个 notebook 用同样的代码打印出来的
The counts are the ones both notebooks printed for the same code.

386
00:24:06,350 --> 00:24:08,692
打印 label 的那一行没有固定的顺序
The labels line has no fixed order,

387
00:24:08,692 --> 00:24:12,238
两个 notebook 就能说明这一点，而且也没有保存 label 映射
as the two notebooks show, and no label map is saved.

388
00:24:12,558 --> 00:24:14,658
这段 summary 最后多出来一个 None
The summary ends with a stray None,

389
00:24:14,658 --> 00:24:17,358
因为代码打印的是 summary 的返回值
because the code prints what summary returns.

390
00:24:17,678 --> 00:24:21,810
训练本身在这里是一段空白，没有 epoch、loss，也没有时间
Training itself is a gap here, with no epochs, loss or times,

391
00:24:21,810 --> 00:24:24,248
然后是那行 Training Job Complete
then the line Training Job Complete.

392
00:24:24,483 --> 00:24:28,068
要查看指标，README 让你去 W&B 的项目
To view metrics, the README sends you to the W&B

393
00:24:28,068 --> 00:24:30,606
cheese-training-vertex-ai
project cheese-training-vertex-ai.

394
00:24:30,926 --> 00:24:34,872
它承诺训练指标会被自动追踪、自动更新
It promises training metrics, tracked and updated automatically.

395
00:24:35,192 --> 00:24:37,411
说得客气点，用这份代码做不到
To put it kindly, not with this code.

396
00:24:37,731 --> 00:24:42,001
按 task.py 的写法，以模型命名的那个 run 有 config
From task.py, the run named after the model gets its config,

397
00:24:42,001 --> 00:24:47,694
包括执行时间，还有系统图表，而它的曲线位置一直是空的
including the execution time, and system charts, and its curve slots stay empty.

398
00:24:48,014 --> 00:24:49,912
暂停一下，打开你的项目
Pause and open your project.

399
00:24:50,150 --> 00:24:53,179
来想一个问题，用课上列的七样
Something to ponder, with the lecture's list of seven.

400
00:24:53,499 --> 00:24:55,888
这个 run 实际存下了哪几样？
Which of them does this run actually keep?

401
00:25:04,733 --> 00:25:06,610
模型和它的设置，有
The model and its settings, yes.

402
00:25:06,930 --> 00:25:13,352
环境只算一部分：有系统图表，而 image 的 tag 写在 cli.sh 里
The environment only partly: system charts, while the image tag sits in cli.sh.

403
00:25:13,672 --> 00:25:17,405
指标，没有：执行时间进了 config
Metrics, none: the execution time goes into the config.

404
00:25:17,725 --> 00:25:19,453
日志有，权重没有
Logs yes, weights no.

405
00:25:19,773 --> 00:25:21,369
代码、数据和笔记，没有
Code, data and notes, no:

406
00:25:21,369 --> 00:25:24,658
没有 commit，一个固定的 zip 包，还有一次没有随机种子的划分
no commit, a fixed zip, and an unseeded split.

407
00:25:24,978 --> 00:25:29,714
notebook A 的那个目录没有 commit，没有划分，也没有笔记
The folder from notebook A has no commit, no split and no notes either.

408
00:25:30,034 --> 00:25:33,405
所以结论是：这些表选不出哪种做法更好
So the verdict: these tables cannot crown a recipe.

409
00:25:33,725 --> 00:25:37,608
给划分加上随机种子，对齐 epoch，记下代码版本，然后再比较
Seed the split, match the epochs, keep the code version, then compare.

410
00:25:37,928 --> 00:25:40,274
练习 1 会加一个小小的 callback
Exercise 1 adds a small callback.

411
00:25:41,317 --> 00:25:44,799
现在反过来看 README 那个可选的 CPU 步骤
Now the reverse of the README's optional CPU step:

412
00:25:44,799 --> 00:25:47,376
要在 GPU 上训练，需要什么？
what would it take to train on a GPU?

413
00:25:47,696 --> 00:25:49,402
三个开关必须一致
Three switches must agree.

414
00:25:49,722 --> 00:25:53,221
加速器：worker pool spec 里的一块 T4
The accelerator: one T4 in the worker pool spec.

415
00:25:53,541 --> 00:25:56,471
image：为 GPU 构建的 TensorFlow
The image: TensorFlow built for GPUs,

416
00:25:56,471 --> 00:25:58,768
带 CUDA，也就是 GPU 的库
with CUDA, the GPU libraries.

417
00:25:59,088 --> 00:26:02,650
还有配额：这个区域里给自定义训练用的 T4
And the quota: T4s for custom training in this region.

418
00:26:02,970 --> 00:26:05,317
芯片只在三个都打开时才会亮
The chip lights only when all three are on.

419
00:26:06,284 --> 00:26:09,697
配额就是准备工作那一章里在控制台提交的申请
The quota is the console request from the setup chapter.

420
00:26:10,017 --> 00:26:13,946
额外检查显示，Google 两个 GPU image 都还在提供
An extra check shows Google still serves both GPU images,

421
00:26:13,946 --> 00:26:15,670
这是录制时的情况
at the time of recording.

422
00:26:15,917 --> 00:26:20,568
要切换，就取消 GPU 那一段的注释，再把 CPU 那一段注释掉
To switch, uncomment the GPU block and comment out the CPU block.

423
00:26:20,888 --> 00:26:24,685
两段都留着，你就会提交两个同名的任务
Leave both active, and you submit two jobs with the same name.

424
00:26:24,934 --> 00:26:29,299
在这里，GPU 那一段会和我们提交 CPU 任务时一样失败
Here the GPU block would fail the same way as our CPU submit did,

425
00:26:29,299 --> 00:26:34,470
因为没有激活的账号，所以没有新东西可看，我们也不造假
with no active account, so there is nothing new to show, and nothing we fake.

426
00:26:34,717 --> 00:26:40,498
金色标签：GPU 会增加费用，只要它挂着，不管用没用
A gold tag: a GPU adds to the bill for as long as it is attached, used or not.

427
00:26:40,734 --> 00:26:42,334
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

428
00:26:42,398 --> 00:26:44,958
你在 CPU 那一段里加上加速器
You add the accelerator to the CPU block.

429
00:26:45,278 --> 00:26:49,950
任务跑起来了，日志里 GPU Available 后面是一个空列表
The job runs, and its log says GPU Available: [], an empty list.

430
00:26:50,270 --> 00:26:51,870
为什么？
Why?

431
00:26:57,834 --> 00:27:01,589
第 31 行设的是 CPU image，里面没有 CUDA
Line 31 sets a CPU image, which has no CUDA.

432
00:27:01,909 --> 00:27:04,831
这块 T4 挂着、闲着，照样计费
The T4 is attached, idle, and still billed.

433
00:27:05,151 --> 00:27:07,284
练习 5 让你自己试一试
Exercise 5 lets you try it.

434
00:27:08,333 --> 00:27:13,148
课上讲的最后一个想法是多 GPU 训练，有三种形态
The last idea of the lecture is multi-GPU training, in three shapes:

435
00:27:13,148 --> 00:27:18,317
一台机器一块 GPU，一台机器多块 GPU，以及多台机器
one machine with one GPU, one machine with several, and several machines.

436
00:27:18,637 --> 00:27:21,304
今天讲中间那种形态，也就是 MirroredStrategy
Today is the middle one, the mirrored strategy.

437
00:27:21,624 --> 00:27:26,765
单 GPU 的训练脚本也会创建一个，但只是用来数 GPU
The single-GPU trainer also creates one, but only to count GPUs.

438
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:28,529
思路是这样的
Here is the idea.

439
00:27:28,579 --> 00:27:33,080
每块 GPU 上都有一份一模一样的模型拷贝，叫作副本
Each GPU holds an identical copy of the model, called a replica.

440
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:38,755
64 的全局 batch，也就是一步的量，被分成两半，每半 32
A global batch of 64, one step's worth, splits into two halves of 32.

441
00:27:39,075 --> 00:27:41,933
每块 GPU 在自己那一半上算梯度
Each GPU computes gradients on its half.

442
00:27:42,253 --> 00:27:45,535
两份梯度通过一条叫 all-reduce 的连线取平均
The two are averaged across a link called all-reduce,

443
00:27:45,535 --> 00:27:49,187
两份拷贝走同样的一步，所以一直保持一致
and both copies take the same step, so they stay identical.

444
00:27:49,507 --> 00:27:52,979
在 strategy.scope 里创建的变量会被复制
Variables created inside the scope are mirrored,

445
00:27:52,979 --> 00:27:54,716
每块 GPU 一份同步的拷贝
one synced copy per GPU;

446
00:27:54,716 --> 00:27:57,464
在外面构建的模型不会被复制
a model built outside is not mirrored.

447
00:27:57,700 --> 00:28:03,823
先看 cli-multi-gpu.sh，按 README 的顺序；暂停一下，打开它
Review cli-multi-gpu.sh first, in README order; pause and open it.

448
00:28:04,143 --> 00:28:07,411
它申请一台 n1-standard-32 机器
It asks for one n1-standard-32 machine

449
00:28:07,411 --> 00:28:09,732
带两块 T4，训练 5 个 epoch
with two T4s, for 5 epochs.

450
00:28:10,052 --> 00:28:14,977
有一个小疏漏：它的 TensorFlow image 比较老
A small slip: its TensorFlow image is older,

451
00:28:14,977 --> 00:28:18,222
是 2.14，而 cli.sh 用的是 2.17
2.14, where cli.sh uses 2.17.

452
00:28:18,466 --> 00:28:22,221
然后看多 GPU 训练脚本；暂停一下，打开它
Then review the multi-GPU trainer; pause and open it.

453
00:28:22,541 --> 00:28:24,717
这就是课上讲的三处改动
These are the lecture's three changes.

454
00:28:25,037 --> 00:28:26,999
它创建 MirroredStrategy
It creates the mirrored strategy.

455
00:28:27,319 --> 00:28:30,754
它把 batch 大小乘以副本数
It multiplies the batch size by the number of replicas.

456
00:28:31,074 --> 00:28:35,277
并且在 strategy.scope 里构建、编译模型
And it builds and compiles the model inside the scope of the strategy.

457
00:28:35,597 --> 00:28:37,304
而 model.fit 没变
model.fit is unchanged.

458
00:28:37,550 --> 00:28:39,150
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

459
00:28:39,214 --> 00:28:45,166
两块 GPU，batch 大小参数是 32，一共 936 张训练图片
Two GPUs, --batch_size=32, and 936 training images.

460
00:28:45,486 --> 00:28:50,179
每个 epoch 有多少步，每块 GPU 每一步看到多少张图片？
How many steps per epoch, and how many images does each GPU see per step?

461
00:28:59,016 --> 00:29:03,953
全局 batch 是 64，所以是 15 步，最后一步不满
The global batch is 64, so 15 steps, the last one partial,

462
00:29:03,953 --> 00:29:07,357
每个完整的步里每块 GPU 拿 32 张
and 32 images per GPU on each full step.

463
00:29:07,677 --> 00:29:09,099
有两点要注意
Two caveats.

464
00:29:09,149 --> 00:29:13,821
学习率还是 0.001，而 batch 翻了一倍
The learning rate stays at 0.001 while the batch doubles.

465
00:29:14,141 --> 00:29:16,465
而且两块 GPU 不会快一倍
And two GPUs are not twice as fast,

466
00:29:16,465 --> 00:29:20,115
因为启动、拉取 image 和下载都不会变短
because start-up, image pull and download don't shrink.

467
00:29:20,350 --> 00:29:26,515
你需要所在区域里自定义训练的配额：两块 T4 和 32 个虚拟 CPU
You need quota for two T4s and 32 virtual CPUs of custom training in your region.

468
00:29:26,835 --> 00:29:32,382
金色标签：这是这节课最大的机器，所以先看价目页
A gold tag: this is the biggest machine of the lecture, so check the pricing page first.

469
00:29:32,702 --> 00:29:38,249
如果你的配额批下来了，暂停一下，跑 sh cli-multi-gpu.sh
If your quota came through, pause and run sh cli-multi-gpu.sh.

470
00:29:38,569 --> 00:29:42,686
在这里，它和 cli.sh 一样失败，没有激活的账号
Here it fails like cli.sh, with no active account.

471
00:29:43,733 --> 00:29:47,825
还有一种 README 从没提过的启动方式
One launcher the README never mentions is cli.py,

472
00:29:47,825 --> 00:29:49,578
cli.py，走 Python SDK 的路线
the Python SDK route.

473
00:29:49,898 --> 00:29:52,564
额外跑一下，它马上就失败了
As an extra run, it fails at once,

474
00:29:52,564 --> 00:29:56,405
因为只有 cli.sh 设置了 region 变量
because only cli.sh sets the GCP_REGION variable.

475
00:29:56,725 --> 00:29:59,520
把它 export 之后，它又卡在缺失的密钥文件上
Export it, and it fails at the missing key file.

476
00:30:02,450 --> 00:30:04,178
那训练好的模型在哪儿？
And where is the trained model?

477
00:30:04,498 --> 00:30:08,854
脚本结束时，机器被删掉，权重也跟着没了
When the script ends, the machine is deleted, and the weights with it:

478
00:30:08,854 --> 00:30:12,711
没有任何地方调用 model.save，model dir 参数也被忽略了
nothing calls model.save, and the --model-dir flag is ignored.

479
00:30:13,031 --> 00:30:18,130
第 15 讲会把模型存进 bucket；练习 4 今天就做
Lecture 15 saves the model to a bucket; exercise 4 does it today.

480
00:30:18,366 --> 00:30:21,310
该收尾了；暂停一下，照着清单一项项做
Time to shut down; pause and work through the list.

481
00:30:21,630 --> 00:30:27,390
在驾驶舱里或者控制台上，确认没有自定义任务还在运行或者排队
From inside the cockpit, or in the console, make sure no custom job is running or pending.

482
00:30:27,710 --> 00:30:30,526
也把 tar 包和实验目录删掉
Remove the tarball and experiment folders too.

483
00:30:30,846 --> 00:30:34,302
然后 exit；额外跑一下 docker ps，什么都没剩
Then exit; an extra docker ps shows nothing left.

484
00:30:34,622 --> 00:30:39,081
结束最后一个 W&B run，断开 Colab 的运行时
Finish the last W&B run, and disconnect the Colab runtimes.

485
00:30:39,401 --> 00:30:42,716
学期结束时，删掉 model-trainer 的密钥
At the end of term, delete the model-trainer key

486
00:30:42,716 --> 00:30:46,100
并轮换你的 W&B 密钥，因为它跟着任务出去过
and rotate your W&B key, which traveled in a job.

487
00:30:46,350 --> 00:30:48,142
整节课都在一张地图上
The whole lecture on one map.

488
00:30:48,462 --> 00:30:51,150
一个 run 有多大用处，取决于它存下了什么
A run is only as useful as what it keeps.

489
00:30:51,470 --> 00:30:55,033
曲线要靠 callback；config 要放进 wandb.init
Curves need a callback; config goes into wandb.init.

490
00:30:55,353 --> 00:30:58,357
只有 tar 包会被带过去，装进 Google 的 image
Only the tarball travels, into Google's image,

491
00:30:58,357 --> 00:31:01,753
以服务代理的身份运行，你的密钥就在它的参数里
run as the service agent, your key in its arguments.

492
00:31:02,073 --> 00:31:07,491
一块 GPU 要三个开关；两块 GPU 分开 batch，再平均梯度
One GPU needs three switches; two GPUs split the batch and average gradients.

493
00:31:09,316 --> 00:31:11,321
五道自测题
5 questions to test yourself.

494
00:31:11,641 --> 00:31:13,924
第一题：两张表都没写下来的是什么？
One: what did neither table write down?

495
00:31:14,244 --> 00:31:17,828
第二题：什么会被带到 Vertex AI，什么从来不会？
Two: what travels to Vertex AI, and what never does?

496
00:31:18,148 --> 00:31:20,367
第三题：为什么 config 是空的？
Three: why is the config empty?

497
00:31:20,687 --> 00:31:24,079
第四题：谁提交，谁运行，你的密钥最后到了哪里？
Four: who submits, who runs, and where does your key end up?

498
00:31:24,399 --> 00:31:26,760
第五题：用两块 GPU 时，什么被分开
Five: with two GPUs, what is split,

499
00:31:26,760 --> 00:31:29,391
什么被平均，什么在 strategy.scope 里创建？
averaged, and created inside the scope?

500
00:31:29,633 --> 00:31:31,681
答案在练习里
Answers are in the exercises.

501
00:31:32,001 --> 00:31:35,726
接下来，第 14 讲把 container 部署成服务，不用自己管服务器
Next, lecture 14 serves containers without servers,

502
00:31:35,726 --> 00:31:39,596
第 15 讲会保存这个模型，并把各个步骤串起来
and lecture 15 saves this model and chains the steps.

503
00:31:39,916 --> 00:31:43,180
硬件租到了，还有一份记录，写着你租它做了什么
Hardware rented, and a log of what you rented it for.
